OL,3,GNEWSACharges against six men in '#7.1m
OL,4,Acannabis farm' case dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix Vietnamese men accused of being
OL,7,Finvolved in a large cannabis factory at
OL,8,Fa derelict school have had charges
OL,9,Fagainst them dropped.
OL,11,FThong Vo, 38, Chinh Nguyen, 44, Diep
OL,12,FVan Le, 47, Trung Nguyen, 35, Pham Quoc
OL,13,FAnh, 23, and Nam Viet Le, 23, were
OL,14,Falleged to have been part of the
OL,15,Fproduction and supply of the drug
OL,16,Fbetween 1 July last year and 1
OL,17,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
