OL,3,GNEWSACharges against six men in '#7.1m
OL,4,Acannabis farm' case dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice at the time of the search said
OL,7,Fcannabis with an estimated street value
OL,8,Fof #7.1m had been discovered at the
OL,9,Fformer Wick High School in the
OL,10,FHighlands.
OL,12,FThe Crown Office and Procurator Fiscal
OL,13,FService (COPFS) said it reserved the
OL,14,Fright to go ahead with criminal
OL,15,Fproceeding in the future should further
OL,16,Fevidence become available.
